WEBVTT

00:23.410 --> 00:30.380
It's right before your eyes... Just a little more...

00:30.630 --> 00:35.470
Your dream is right there.

00:36.180 --> 00:41.390
Only a small hunch...

00:41.640 --> 00:45.480
...keeps your hopes up now.

00:45.730 --> 00:50.860
In this endless, dark maze,

00:50.980 --> 00:54.990
strength is realizing...

00:55.740 --> 00:57.780
...your own weakness.

00:57.780 --> 01:01.120
Taking in the shining wind,

01:01.120 --> 01:06.120
you can fly...

01:06.670 --> 01:08.880
...towards the vast sky.

01:11.960 --> 01:15.970
When even the deepest darkness turns into light...

01:16.050 --> 01:23.560
...I believe in that instant.

01:24.230 --> 01:27.810
I'll keep on believing...

01:52.880 --> 01:56.920
Cleopatra's Love

01:57.340 --> 01:59.390
<i>But we've finally met! Why?!</i>

01:59.390 --> 02:03.760
<i>I'm not the same person you used to know. We're finished.</i>

02:03.760 --> 02:06.180
<i>Then, what was the promise we made for?!</i>

02:06.180 --> 02:09.020
<i>Was the undying love you promised a lie?!</i>

02:09.020 --> 02:11.400
<i>Say whatever you want.</i>

02:11.400 --> 02:12.730
<i>Anthony!</i>

02:12.730 --> 02:17.110
<i>I love you! Take me to the ends of the earth!</i>

02:17.110 --> 02:18.110
<i>Cleopatra...</i>

02:18.110 --> 02:20.200
Class President, see you tomorrow!

02:21.030 --> 02:25.080
Kusakabe-san! Would you like to see this movie with...

02:28.000 --> 02:30.370
W-Wait!

02:35.210 --> 02:38.090
So that's the heir to the Minazuki Group.

02:38.760 --> 02:40.720
Kusakabe-san!

02:40.720 --> 02:43.350
He likes that girl.

02:43.350 --> 02:45.010
All right!!!

02:45.770 --> 02:48.730
Wow! You two are perfect!

02:48.730 --> 02:50.810
W-What the...?

02:50.810 --> 02:54.440
Oh, this, this! Piccolo Spooooorts Drink!

02:55.150 --> 03:01.950
I've been looking for just the perfect couple for a new TV commercial!

03:01.950 --> 03:05.280
You two fit the image perfectly!

03:06.040 --> 03:09.540
I'd really like for both of you to be in the commercial!

03:09.540 --> 03:11.250
B-Both of us?

03:11.250 --> 03:14.380
Yes, right here! Call me right here!

03:15.540 --> 03:18.800
Shinonome Talent Agency?

03:18.800 --> 03:20.590
Well, see you later!

03:20.590 --> 03:22.590
Wait a minute!

03:29.810 --> 03:34.310
Kaitou Finally Shows up on Commercials?!

03:37.110 --> 03:39.740
Creative Design Office...

03:41.200 --> 03:43.820
Your withdrawal of one million yen.

03:43.820 --> 03:45.320
Thank you.

03:51.040 --> 03:53.580
Excuse me, Miss?

03:53.580 --> 03:55.330
I'm a police officer.

03:57.000 --> 04:02.760
There's a possibility that counterfeit money is mixed in with the withdrawal you just made at this bank.

04:02.760 --> 04:04.180
What?! Counterfeit money?!

04:04.180 --> 04:06.680
Yes. I need to verify this, so will you please go back inside?

04:06.680 --> 04:08.310
O-Okay...

04:08.310 --> 04:10.350
Oh, excuse me. Your bag.

04:10.350 --> 04:11.600
What?!

04:11.600 --> 04:13.480
I need to hold on to the evidence.

04:13.480 --> 04:15.270
I see...

04:19.320 --> 04:22.400
Hey! W-What's going on?!

04:25.240 --> 04:29.120
I-I was tricked? T-Thief!!!

04:30.040 --> 04:32.080
I'm a con artist!

04:35.250 --> 04:37.840
I got a million yen!

04:41.760 --> 04:44.880
I even got a stylish suit as a bonus!

04:48.970 --> 04:51.060
Would you like some sweet candy?

05:10.490 --> 05:12.250
You are working so hard, all alone.

05:13.290 --> 05:15.040
Hijiri-sensei...

05:33.890 --> 05:35.060
That was close.

05:37.810 --> 05:39.560
Sorry!

05:44.400 --> 05:47.280
You are the flower of the Momokuri Academy Gymnastics Team.

05:47.280 --> 05:49.660
It would be a tragedy if you were hurt.

05:50.990 --> 05:52.620
Nagoya-kun!

05:54.250 --> 05:55.450
Hurry, hurry!

05:58.250 --> 06:00.460
W-What should we do?

06:00.460 --> 06:01.630
Do what?

06:01.630 --> 06:05.050
Nagoya-kun, doesn't it bother you?

06:05.050 --> 06:06.420
Not really.

06:06.420 --> 06:09.840
Let's get the cleaning done. Don't slack off.

06:11.600 --> 06:15.270
It looks like Nagoya-kun isn't the only rival anymore.

06:21.770 --> 06:24.780
Your performance is always so graceful.

06:24.780 --> 06:27.030
Please keep doing your best.

06:29.910 --> 06:33.660
Maron, what were you and Shikaido-sensei talking about?

06:33.660 --> 06:36.120
<i>A mysterious teacher...</i>

06:37.000 --> 06:40.370
Hey, Maron! What were you two talking about?!

06:40.370 --> 06:42.130
Huh? What?

06:42.130 --> 06:44.880
Listen to me when I'm talking to you.

06:51.260 --> 06:54.100
<i>Hello, Shinonome Talent Agency.</i>

06:54.100 --> 06:57.480
Um, I'm Momokuri Academy's...

06:57.480 --> 07:00.600
<i>Yo, Minazuki-kun! Thanks for calling!</i>

07:00.600 --> 07:03.060
How did you know my name?

07:03.060 --> 07:05.570
I could never forget you.

07:05.570 --> 07:09.530
Have you decided on being in the commercial with Kusakabe Maron-chan?

07:09.530 --> 07:11.240
<i>Can we really be in it?</i>

07:11.240 --> 07:12.780
Leave it to me!

07:12.780 --> 07:18.040
Once you appear in the Piccolo Sports Drink commercial, you two will become wildly popular idols!

07:18.040 --> 07:22.710
Also, the love between you and Maron-chan will blossom, baby!

07:22.710 --> 07:24.960
Love will blossom?!

07:24.960 --> 07:30.300
<i>Oh, yes. You two are going to be together all the time! Yay!</i>

07:30.300 --> 07:33.140
Please let me do this!

07:33.390 --> 07:38.060
Ok, Ok. But Maron-chan has to do it with you.

07:38.060 --> 07:40.390
Also, you two are totally new.

07:40.390 --> 07:43.400
It'll take some money to advertise you guys. Is that okay?

07:43.400 --> 07:45.730
<i>How much money?</i>

07:47.440 --> 07:49.030
One million yen.

07:49.030 --> 07:50.400
One million yen?!

07:51.700 --> 07:56.120
<i>But if you go on the commercial, the pay is ten million yen!</i>

07:56.120 --> 07:57.950
Ten million!

07:57.950 --> 08:03.460
Your love with Maron-chan will blossom, you'll get ten million yen, and you will be wildly happy!

08:03.460 --> 08:05.540
One million yen...

08:05.540 --> 08:08.590
<i>I'm going to ask Grandpa...</i>

08:11.090 --> 08:13.680
We'll go over the details when we meet.

08:13.680 --> 08:16.890
Maron-chan has to come, too!

08:16.890 --> 08:19.140
<i>O-Of course.</i>

08:19.140 --> 08:20.730
I'm leaving it to you.

08:26.230 --> 08:30.070
So please! Be in the commercial with me!

08:30.070 --> 08:33.900
It's not that I'm not interested...

08:33.900 --> 08:36.490
...but doesn't it sound too good to be true?

08:36.490 --> 08:38.490
Please!

08:38.490 --> 08:42.660
A million yen to get ten million yen... Sounds kinda fishy.

08:45.250 --> 08:47.420
Yo, Minazuki-kun! Sorry to keep you waiting!

08:48.380 --> 08:49.880
Shinonome-san!

08:53.720 --> 08:57.800
The shooting schedule is set. Tomorrow at 6:00 P.M.

08:57.800 --> 09:00.220
The place is the Momokuri Movie Studio!

09:01.470 --> 09:02.680
A Demon is...!

09:02.680 --> 09:06.440
Will you bring the one million yen at that time?

09:06.440 --> 09:08.270
Got it!

09:08.270 --> 09:09.940
Here's the map.

09:09.940 --> 09:12.740
We'll meet at the front gate of the studio.

09:12.740 --> 09:15.280
The details are written here.

09:15.280 --> 09:17.450
Maron-chan, please come too!

09:17.450 --> 09:19.080
Y-Yes...

09:22.080 --> 09:26.460
<i>The horses have turned the fourth corner! Three horses are neck-and-neck.</i>

09:26.460 --> 09:30.040
<i>Here comes Norinochazuke flying by!</i>

09:30.040 --> 09:32.590
<i>Can Short Conbu and Nebanatto do it?!</i>

09:32.590 --> 09:35.840
Go! Run! Nebanatto!

09:35.840 --> 09:38.430
<i>They can't catch up! It's Momokurisuta!</i>

09:38.430 --> 09:40.970
<i>Then comes Short Conbu with half a horse length on Nebanatto!</i>

09:40.970 --> 09:46.480
<i>First place is Momokurisuta! Second is Short Conbu. Nebanatto finished in fourth place!</i>

09:46.480 --> 09:48.690
Damn! I've got no luck!

09:52.150 --> 09:55.400
Hey, buddy! You've got something on your back!

09:57.740 --> 09:59.780
What the...!

10:01.780 --> 10:04.660
<i>Notice to Shinonome Youichiro-sama:</i>

10:04.660 --> 10:10.750
<i>"Tomorrow at 6:00 P.M., I'm taking the beauty of your clothes." - Kaitou Jeanne</i>

10:10.750 --> 10:13.500
Looks like the plan is going well.

10:13.500 --> 10:16.630
All that's left is to lure her into the studio and kill her.

10:16.630 --> 10:19.510
Me?! Kill...!

10:19.510 --> 10:22.640
Of course! That's what you're for!

10:25.350 --> 10:29.350
A special service. I'm giving you another one.

10:39.240 --> 10:44.120
Kill Jeanne... Kill Jeanne!

10:44.120 --> 10:51.040
Good. Nicely done. Be sure to kill Jeanne.

10:59.130 --> 11:02.260
What?! A notice from Kaitou Jeanne?!

11:02.260 --> 11:07.560
Yes, sir! There was a call saying that a strange man had a notice stuck on his back.

11:07.560 --> 11:12.520
It seems that Jeanne is after his flashy clothes.

11:12.520 --> 11:14.860
Why would she want something like that?

11:14.860 --> 11:16.860
Did she have that kind of taste?

11:16.860 --> 11:19.900
The problem is the target!

11:19.900 --> 11:21.950
It's Shinonome Youichiro!

11:21.950 --> 11:25.490
A con artist with sixteen previous crimes. He just recently got out.

11:25.490 --> 11:26.990
What?!

11:26.990 --> 11:28.660
Please wait a second.

11:31.210 --> 11:34.420
Here it is. Shinonome Youichiro.

11:34.420 --> 11:37.250
Sometimes poses as an elite international pilot.

11:38.460 --> 11:41.680
Or a delightful athlete.

11:41.680 --> 11:47.310
Or even a beautiful secretary of a diplomat.

11:47.310 --> 11:49.980
He's a con artist who tricks people into giving him money.

11:49.980 --> 11:53.020
Why would Jeanne want his clothes?

11:53.020 --> 11:57.110
Okay. Let's use him as bait to capture Jeanne.

11:57.110 --> 11:58.230
Yes, sir!

11:58.230 --> 12:00.440
I have to inform Miyako-san.

12:03.490 --> 12:05.490
What?! A notice?!

12:05.490 --> 12:08.700
What are you going to do, Sinbad?!

12:08.700 --> 12:11.120
Save Maron, of course!

12:11.120 --> 12:12.830
Okay! Got it!

12:26.510 --> 12:31.770
Like I said, I have to meet someone at 6 P.M.

12:31.770 --> 12:35.310
Would you please cooperate with us for a little bit?

12:35.310 --> 12:38.230
I'm not going to cooperate with the police.

12:38.230 --> 12:43.360
How about you tell me who the other party is and we'll give them a call.

12:45.160 --> 12:46.740
Hey, Fuyuta.

12:46.740 --> 12:48.580
Yes, sir.

12:48.580 --> 12:50.830
So who is this person?

12:50.830 --> 12:53.460
Please tell me their name and phone number.

12:53.460 --> 12:54.960
Fine! Geez!

12:59.300 --> 13:03.550
They really made these things well! It seems almost real.

13:03.550 --> 13:05.300
Catch, Natsuda!

13:05.300 --> 13:09.220
This is no time to be playing!

13:09.220 --> 13:11.100
Nice header!

13:11.100 --> 13:13.730
Let him go once we catch Jeanne.

13:13.730 --> 13:14.980
Wait here!

13:14.980 --> 13:18.560
H-Hey! That's not nice!

13:36.870 --> 13:40.040
<i>Why was that guy possessed by a Demon?</i>

13:47.090 --> 13:48.550
Class President!

13:54.220 --> 13:56.060
<i>Fin, lend me your power!</i>

13:56.060 --> 13:58.650
<i>Deliver my wish to Jeanne d'Arc!</i>

14:20.330 --> 14:22.420
<i>Strong and serious...</i>

14:22.420 --> 14:24.550
<i>Matchless and marvelous...</i>

14:24.550 --> 14:26.300
<i>Energetic and courageous!</i>

14:32.930 --> 14:37.020
<i>Kaitou Jeanne has arrived by the order of God!</i>

14:39.900 --> 14:41.440
<i>For the two lovers...</i>

14:43.230 --> 14:45.940
<i>A perfectly delightful, refreshing sports drink!</i>

14:45.940 --> 14:47.360
<i>There's chestnut flavor, too.</i>

14:48.740 --> 14:51.370
<i>Drink and the two of you will fall in love!</i>

14:51.370 --> 14:54.330
Piccolo Sports Drink!

14:55.790 --> 14:57.830
I wish!

14:57.830 --> 15:01.500
This one million will become ten million!

15:01.500 --> 15:06.300
Maybe, just maybe, this commercial will be the beginning of...!

15:10.550 --> 15:14.010
I wish! I wish! I wish!

15:15.140 --> 15:17.270
I'll be borrowing this!

15:17.270 --> 15:21.190
Thief! Without that...

15:21.190 --> 15:23.610
...I can't be in the commercial.

15:27.280 --> 15:31.530
You've arrived, Jeanne. Now, let the fun begin.

15:34.910 --> 15:36.790
Jeanne has arrived!

15:41.250 --> 15:42.790
Adieu!

15:47.710 --> 15:50.630
Shinonome Youichiro... Found you!

16:11.150 --> 16:13.660
Oh, it's just a movie...!

16:21.540 --> 16:23.290
Kaitou Jeanne...

16:24.290 --> 16:26.290
There's no way out.

16:37.260 --> 16:40.020
Our plan has succeeded.

16:40.020 --> 16:42.100
Where's Shinonome Youichiro?

16:42.100 --> 16:44.850
You're finished Jeanne!

16:55.110 --> 16:55.910
What?!

16:56.820 --> 16:58.330
Damn! Get her!

16:58.330 --> 17:00.120
Hurry! Open the door!

17:04.460 --> 17:06.000
Adieu!

17:11.170 --> 17:13.420
Where's Shinonome Youichiro?

17:24.890 --> 17:28.060
Is that real...?! It couldn't...

17:32.190 --> 17:33.650
No way!

17:35.530 --> 17:37.280
This is next.

17:45.870 --> 17:47.920
Now, it's your turn.

18:05.600 --> 18:08.060
Die!

18:36.670 --> 18:38.430
Are you all right?

18:38.430 --> 18:40.390
Why did you save me?!

18:40.390 --> 18:43.470
Stop getting involved with the Demons!

18:45.720 --> 18:47.560
I refuse!

18:47.560 --> 18:50.520
I'm not believing anything you say!

18:50.770 --> 18:51.980
Jeanne!

18:51.980 --> 18:53.940
You're such an annoyance!

18:56.030 --> 18:57.240
Wait!

19:02.990 --> 19:03.910
I've found you!

19:09.040 --> 19:10.830
I'm going to finish this!

19:19.300 --> 19:21.470
You've finally shown yourself!

19:31.020 --> 19:32.980
What strength!

19:48.080 --> 19:49.710
In the name of God...

19:51.790 --> 19:54.210
You, a Demon, born in darkness...

19:56.960 --> 19:59.720
I seal you here!

20:09.640 --> 20:11.310
<i>Checkmate!</i>

20:18.150 --> 20:20.190
<i>Collection completed!</i>

20:22.110 --> 20:25.870
You were doing so well, but you just had to disappoint me.

20:27.620 --> 20:29.620
Jeanne is a strong opponent.

20:29.620 --> 20:32.830
You have to weaken both body and soul to defeat her.

20:40.260 --> 20:43.090
Jeanne, I'll be playing with you again.

20:45.430 --> 20:48.810
This is indecent exposure!

20:50.310 --> 20:51.810
Hey, are you awake?

20:51.810 --> 20:53.770
O-O-Officer!

20:53.770 --> 20:55.730
Shinonome Youichiro!

20:55.730 --> 20:58.610
There was a crime report from Creative Design!

20:58.610 --> 21:03.490
One million yen in cash and a suit worth 80,000 yen!

21:03.490 --> 21:05.070
Where did you hide them?!

21:05.070 --> 21:07.870
Could you do something about your clothes?!

21:08.990 --> 21:10.450
S-S-Sorry...

21:10.450 --> 21:12.410
The money was stolen by Jeanne...

21:12.410 --> 21:14.620
Shinonome-san is nowhere to be seen...

21:14.620 --> 21:16.790
Kusakabe-san hasn't shown up yet...

21:16.790 --> 21:18.630
What am I going to do?

21:20.000 --> 21:21.210
I'm returning this!

21:21.210 --> 21:23.220
K-Kaitou Jeanne!

21:23.880 --> 21:27.140
Don't worry. The money is where it belongs.

21:27.140 --> 21:30.560
From now on, don't be fooled by such simple lies.

21:30.560 --> 21:32.060
Adieu!

21:33.060 --> 21:35.980
Lie? What is she talking about?

21:36.730 --> 21:40.980
Class President! What are you doing here?

21:40.980 --> 21:42.320
Toudaiji-san.

21:42.320 --> 21:44.610
Just now, Kaitou... K-K-K--

21:49.950 --> 21:53.700
Huh? Shinonome-san? Why?

21:53.700 --> 21:57.710
I'm surprised you know this con artist.

21:57.710 --> 21:59.080
Con artist?

22:00.250 --> 22:04.670
If even Minazuki-kun remembers your face, you'll never be able to con anyone ever again!

22:07.550 --> 22:12.850
C-Con artist...? I've been tricked?

22:12.850 --> 22:15.100
Class President, sorry!

22:15.100 --> 22:16.640
K-Kusakabe-san!

22:16.640 --> 22:19.770
I guess I'm a little late!

22:28.610 --> 22:35.250
The thick clouds past and the descending light...

22:36.000 --> 22:44.670
...slowly melts the hardened, damaged past.

22:45.260 --> 22:49.130
Because we live so stiffly,

22:49.130 --> 22:52.850
it's so easy to smash into pieces.

22:53.050 --> 23:01.980
And I never thought that I had anything to protect...

23:02.520 --> 23:05.690
Never forgetting...

23:05.980 --> 23:09.820
...there is unending love.

23:10.530 --> 23:14.580
I'll catch it, I'll steal it.

23:14.740 --> 23:17.870
Then embrace you with it.

23:18.160 --> 23:21.080
Even if there comes a time...

23:21.540 --> 23:26.050
...when this planet is destroyed,

23:26.210 --> 23:30.090
I won't be lonely, I won't be alone.

23:30.340 --> 23:37.890
I'll be embracing an eternal wind.

23:47.570 --> 23:50.990
Jeanne is evil! We must...terminate her!

23:50.990 --> 23:56.120
Wait, Dad! Jeanne is a Kaitou, but we can't use such force without reasonable cause!

23:56.120 --> 24:00.830
No! Humans make mistakes, with or without reason.

24:00.830 --> 24:05.040
In order to reduce these mistakes, the origin itself must be eliminated!

24:05.040 --> 24:06.250
Dad...

24:06.250 --> 24:10.090
Kamikaze Kaitou Jeanne: Kaitou Jeanne Elimination Order!!

24:10.090 --> 24:14.300
Dad is going to kill Jeanne! What am I supposed to do...?
